["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"183期重发 | 投资的周期思维、共识游戏与亏钱教训 Bullwhip Effect Crossing the Chasm\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-01-touzishizhan-全球只有2-4-的公司能让你长期赚钱-其余都该阶段性持有/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/84ddf31325c222e2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"投\"><span class=\"dur\">1:59:41</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">投资实战派</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1101</span></div>\n<h2>全球只有2.4%的公司能让你长期赚钱，其余都该阶段性持有</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">统计显示2.4%之外的公司大多让收益原地打转甚至归零，这期给出了判断一家公司是否属于那2.4%的具体方法：预期回报公式、估值锚点和企业生命周期买点。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">价值投资</span><span class=\"tag\">资本周期</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"How a 19-year-old intern built the growth engine behind this $2B AI company | Hector Serrano UGC CPM GMV ICP smart retainer ad fatigue\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-01-lennys-创作者靠广告分成赚钱-而非播放量-撑起20亿美元ai公司/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3c676784fa788b53-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:27:47</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Lenny&#x27;s Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1101</span></div>\n<h2>创作者靠广告分成赚钱，而非播放量，撑起20亿美元AI公司</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">创作者按广告花费抽成、不设上限，靠「smart retainer」兜底，这套付费UGC体系撑起了Whisperflow过去一年30倍的营收增长。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">付费UGC</span><span class=\"tag\">创作者经济</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"How Bending Spoons Built a $20 Billion Compounder | Luca Ferrari SaaSpocalypse\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-01-a16z-ai把代码成本打到近零-但多数软件护城河并未坍塌/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">44:20</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1101</span></div>\n<h2>AI把代码成本打到近零，但多数软件护城河并未坍塌</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">多数规模化软件产品的复制成本在AI出现前就已经很低，它们真正的护城河是习惯、网络效应和专有数据，而非代码本身的稀缺性。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">护城河</span><span class=\"tag\">SaaS</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"TWiV 1371: How to Bat Away Marburg Virus clade / genotype TMRCA reassortment α-2,6 sialic acid receptor interferon epsilon\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-01-twiv-水貂感染h5n1-传播路径空白三个月-美国农业部选择不查/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://www.microbe.tv/wp-content/uploads/2018/09/TWiV_v3_white.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:49:03</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Virology</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1101</span></div>\n<h2>水貂感染H5N1,传播路径空白三个月，美国农业部选择不查</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">得州奶牛场与犹他水貂场的H5N1已经对上信号，但中间三个月的传播链没人查——美国农业部没要求扑杀，也不监测工人和周边农场。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">H5N1禽流感</span><span class=\"tag\">水貂</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"The Mycenaeans: Was Agamemnon Real? Linear B Wanax Tholos tomb Cyclopean walls Corbelling Sea Peoples\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-01-ancients-荷马史诗英雄的名字-其实是迈锡尼泥板上的普通人名/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/27f59ba28fc2607a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:07:37</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Ancients</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1101</span></div>\n<h2>荷马史诗英雄的名字，其实是迈锡尼泥板上的普通人名</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">迈锡尼王宫的记账泥板上，埃特奥克勒斯、阿喀琉斯只是欠王宫东西的普通百姓名字——荷马史诗里的英雄名，原来是当时随处可见的称呼。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">迈锡尼</span><span class=\"tag\">青铜时代</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"AI:AM: Carbon in the Arena, Mistral&#x27;s Le Chonk, the Agent-Run Economy, Ferroelectric RAM + New Hacks EUV Mixture of Experts (MoE) ferroelectric memory APT\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-31-cogrev-生产数据显示openai比anthropic更少撒谎/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bce300797e23ca51-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:27:57</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Cognitive Revolution</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1031</span></div>\n<h2>生产数据显示OpenAI比Anthropic更少撒谎</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Arena用真实生产对话打分：OpenAI在未授权操作、虚假归因、欺骗性完成三项信号上全面反超Anthropic，个位数误导率换算到真实用量已经相当可观。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI对齐</span><span class=\"tag\">开源模型</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Using Agents for Long-Horizon Financial Work — Aman Singh, Arca harness managed agents fiduciary RMD prompt injection\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-31-latentspace-ai原生财富管理公司-不是人在催ai-是ai在催人/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f748ae3e2793f6d3-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">26:05</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1031</span></div>\n<h2>AI原生财富管理公司：不是人在催AI，是AI在催人</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">这家财富管理公司不是套了AI工具的服务商，而是AI原生的公司本身：智能体主动联系顾问与客户、持续追踪他们的税务和退休计划，人类只负责审批和执行交易。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">智能体</span><span class=\"tag\">财富管理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"The Skeptics Guide #1112 - Oct 31 2026 Scopus regression discontinuity design Penning trap CPT symmetry APOE4\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-31-skeptics-超3500家亮红灯的问题期刊-照样被主流数据库收录/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cc4dc31b3b84e70d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:54:32</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Skeptics Guide</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1031</span></div>\n<h2>超3500家亮红灯的问题期刊，照样被主流数据库收录</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">研究发现3753家期刊出现造假预警信号，其中3557家仍被Scopus正常收录，说明「发表论文」本身已不再等于可信。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">科研诚信</span><span class=\"tag\">期刊造假</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"SYMHC Classics: Helen Duncan ectoplasm teleplasm materialization medium Vagrancy Act Witchcraft Act 1735 Fraudulent Mediums Act\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-31-stuffmissed-她在降神会说中两艘军舰沉没-英国用巫术法让她闭嘴/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">38:43</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1031</span></div>\n<h2>她在降神会说中两艘军舰沉没，英国用巫术法让她闭嘴</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">检察官当庭声明这与巫术无关，纯属诈骗，但真正促使动用1735年巫术法的，是她曾说中两艘英国军舰的沉没，军方担心她在诺曼底登陆前走漏消息。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">灵媒诈骗</span><span class=\"tag\">二战谍报</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Dan Williams on Why AI (Probably) Won’t Kill Us AI as Normal Technology stochastic parrots NIMBY post-training conflict entrepreneurs\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-31-goodfight-大语言模型其实是社交媒体的反面-而非升级版/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c75b9a8ba0dff85c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">The Good Fight</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1031</span></div>\n<h2>大语言模型其实是社交媒体的反面，而非升级版</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">社交媒体靠算法放大耸动内容拉低公共讨论，目前的ChatGPT、Claude、Gemini甚至Grok却默认追求准确克制——但这优势未必持久。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">教育</span><span class=\"tag\">虚假信息</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Can AI Fix Professional Networking? | Inside Cosign MCP coincidence of intent golden handcuffs agent-to-agent protocol\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-31-a16z-领英永远不会做的事-开放一张可搜索的人脉信任图谱/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">25:21</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1031</span></div>\n<h2>领英永远不会做的事：开放一张可搜索的人脉信任图谱</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">a16z 押注的 Cosign 认为，招聘的下一步不是海投简历，而是你信任的人——未来甚至是你的 AI agent——替你做第一轮筛选。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI agent</span><span class=\"tag\">招聘</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"TWiV 1370: Clinical Update with Dr. Daniel Griffin clade 2.3.4.4B seroconversion ELISpot assay TH1/TH2 response post-exposure prophylaxis\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-31-twiv-佛罗里达若废除入学强制接种-模型预测五年内数百儿童将死于麻疹/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://www.microbe.tv/wp-content/uploads/2018/09/TWiV_v3_white.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:01:05</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Virology</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1031</span></div>\n<h2>佛罗里达若废除入学强制接种，模型预测五年内数百儿童将死于麻疹</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">用数学模型测算，取消学校强制接种疫苗的要求将在佛罗里达引发近半个世纪来美国最大规模麻疹疫情，五年内数百名儿童和婴儿可能因此死亡。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">公共卫生</span><span class=\"tag\">禽流感</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"⚡ Building ChatGPT for Finance — Joseph Kim, OpenAI&#x27;s Head of Financial Services MCP RLHF reward model readability GDP eval\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-31-latentspace-现成数据接口错误率超40-逼得openai自建数据管道/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c081d94ef2cea125-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">27:34</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1031</span></div>\n<h2>现成数据接口错误率超40%，逼得OpenAI自建数据管道</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">测试发现部分知名MCP数据连接器错误率超40%，促使OpenAI放弃直接调用插件，转而自建数据管道作为金融产品的核心竞争力。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">金融AI</span><span class=\"tag\">企业产品</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Anthropic S-1 Shocker, Greatest Business Ever? Google&#x27;s $500B Wipeout, Midterm Predictions S-1 convertible notes recursive self-improvement (RSI) Vickrey auction ARR\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-30-allin-anthropic800亿美元亏损是假账-实际烧钱不到100亿/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f8f622bd4f103f10-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">1:25:47</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1030</span></div>\n<h2>Anthropic800亿美元亏损是假账，实际烧钱不到100亿</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">那800亿亏损来自给亚马逊等基础设施伙伴发的可转换票据——估值越涨账面亏损越大，但钱从没真花出去，实际总烧钱只有90亿到100亿美元。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Anthropic IPO</span><span class=\"tag\">AI估值</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"The Future of Financial Advice: Masters in Business with Rich Steinmeier RIA wire house non-compete transition assistance ERISA 40-30-30 portfolio\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-30-mastersinbiz-没有竞业协议-顾问随时能走-这家万亿资管公司流失率却最低/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bf628cdceaa5d753-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">1:08:11</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Masters in Business</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1030</span></div>\n<h2>没有竞业协议、顾问随时能走，这家万亿资管公司流失率却最低</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">LPL的顾问是独立老板，没有竞业协议，想走就走，LPL甚至帮他们带走客户资料，逼着自己每天重新赢得信任，流失率因此远低于行业的5%。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">财富管理</span><span class=\"tag\">独立顾问模式</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"What Happens When Everyone Can Build Software RSI vibe coding Lindy effect PLG\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-30-ycsp-数据库公司七成新增用量来自ai代理-不是人类工程师/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/30dacdc60410d57c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"Y\"><span class=\"dur\">48:45</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Y Combinator</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1030</span></div>\n<h2>数据库公司七成新增用量来自AI代理，不是人类工程师</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">各行各业的人不再需要说服工程师才能动手：AI让懂业务的人直接建出复杂系统，这个新建造者群体的增长目前看不到天花板。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI agent</span><span class=\"tag\">开发者工具</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Was I wrong about open models &amp; cyber risks? open-weight model offense-defense balance sigmoid ClickFix\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-30-interconnects-被渲染成网络武器的开源模型发布后-世界并没有崩溃/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e4c5ea11768e1209-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">9:47</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Interconnects</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1030</span></div>\n<h2>被渲染成网络武器的开源模型发布后，世界并没有崩溃</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">开源模型跨过了被认为的网络武器门槛一个多月，没有证据显示发生了质变级灾难，但作者承认这仍将是一场代价不低的行业被迫升级。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">开源模型</span><span class=\"tag\">网络安全</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Robert Caro – The master biographer reflects at 91 eminent domain majority leader\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-30-dwarkesh-写权力如何腐化人的传记作家说-美国建不成东西-是矫枉过正/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/210def115ef0731e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">1:01:10</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Dwarkesh</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1030</span></div>\n<h2>写权力如何腐化人的传记作家说：美国建不成东西，是矫枉过正</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他说如今的环评、社区委员会和诉讼并不比摩西那个年代的建设障碍少；真正稀缺的，是愿意想办法绕开一切阻力把事情做成的那种人。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">基建</span><span class=\"tag\">权力与治理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Silicon Valley Walks the Jagged Edge jagged edge RSI (Recursive Self-Improvement) bullwhip effect golden path structurally short\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-30-asianometry-想做多算力-光囤芯片不够-不借钱加仓就是-结构性做空/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/de22d2d519cce16c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">18:57</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Asianometry</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1030</span></div>\n<h2>想做多算力，光囤芯片不够：不借钱加仓就是「结构性做空」</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">有人向作者解释，光靠融资买够算力已经不算真正「做多」——还得借债加仓芯片，否则就是在「结构性做空」自己，这是硅谷圈内流传的一句玩笑话。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算力</span><span class=\"tag\">半导体设备</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why AI Could Turn Small Law Firms Into Billion-Dollar Businesses contingency (law) plaintiff law cause of action ADR (automated dispute resolution) long horizon agents\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-30-a16z-小型律所靠ai也能做到十亿美元生意/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">53:14</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1030</span></div>\n<h2>小型律所靠AI也能做到十亿美元生意</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">原告律师的瓶颈从来不是案源而是人力：洛杉矶一家律所用AI把人均客户量从100做到500，这才是法律AI真正的市场。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">法律科技</span><span class=\"tag\">AI应用层</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Vol.289｜四夺荆州，三分天下｜嘉宾：谭木声\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-30-cn27f438-赤壁之战的真相-曹操目的不是灭吴-而是追杀刘备/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7d46bbafb24c11f4-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"东\"><span class=\"dur\">1:15:25</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">东腔西调</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1030</span></div>\n<h2>赤壁之战的真相：曹操目的不是灭吴，而是追杀刘备</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">曹操写给孙权的那封信是恐吓信而非劝降信——他南下真实目标是追杀逃亡的刘备，撞上主动迎战的孙权，才被意外拖进赤壁之战，火也烧在乌林而非赤壁。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">荆州</span><span class=\"tag\">三国</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Anthropic Opens the Kimono, Bubble Questions and Frontier Costs, Q&amp;A on Meta, Starlink, Brewers S1 neoclouds Starshield benefit corporation aggregator of aggregators circular financing\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-30-sharptech-anthropic的800亿美元-亏损-只是一场会计幻觉/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7a309a358a363994-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">1:38:03</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Sharp Tech</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1030</span></div>\n<h2>Anthropic的800亿美元「亏损」只是一场会计幻觉</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">这笔钱是亚马逊可转换贷款随估值重新计价产生的账面差额，没有现金流出；真正该担心的是训练成本的增速已经超过服务成本，且完全不受自己控制。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Anthropic</span><span class=\"tag\">IPO</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"“Everyone Else Has One”: What Your Kid’s Envy Is Really Telling You SIREN benign envy / malicious envy 시기 (Shigi) 부러워 (Puro) 장손 (Jangson)\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-30-raisinggh-孩子吵着要iphone-其实要的是不被排除在外/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/071e8b2d9bfabca5-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"R\"><span class=\"dur\">29:22</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Raising Good Humans</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1030</span></div>\n<h2>孩子吵着要iPhone,其实要的是不被排除在外</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">社会学家 Stacy Kim 说嫉妒本身是中性信号：你只会嫉妒离你够近、你也真正在意的人，学会不盯着对方而是追问感受本身，才能把嫉妒变成行动。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">嫉妒心理</span><span class=\"tag\">亲子沟通</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"PHP2Shell Won&#x27;t Be the Last Big AI Cybersecurity Risk minus one-day vulnerability centaur hacker formal verification Pass the Planet\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-30-oddlots-已知两年没人能利用的php漏洞-ai一天写出了攻击代码/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">49:00</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1030</span></div>\n<h2>已知两年没人能利用的PHP漏洞，AI一天写出了攻击代码</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">PHP基金会两年前就知道这个漏洞，却因为没人能证明能利用它而搁置未修；AI一天内就写出了远程攻陷网站的完整攻击代码。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">网络安全</span><span class=\"tag\">AI安全</span>\n</div></div></a>"]